1. INSTALL PYTHON

install python from its official website: https://www.python.org/downloads/
run the .exe installer
run the installer again and click modify
click next and check the box to add python to environment variables

2. INSTALL PYTHON PACKAGES

in CMD or powershell run the following commands:
pip install flask
pip install flask-cors
pip install yt-dlp

3. INSTALL FFMPEG

in CMD or powershell run: winget install ffmpeg

4. RUN THE PYTHON

copy the path of the .py file
in CMD or powershell run: py "file_path"
example: py C:\Users\unai\Desktop\apps\downloader\app.py

5. TEST IT WORKS

if it worked correctly you should see something like:

