6. ACCESS FROM YOUR PHONE

in cmd or powershell run: ipconfig
you will see somewhere something like 192.168.1.143
now on your phone open the browser and go to 192.168.1.143:5000

7. DOWNLOAD VIDEOS AND AUDIOS

you can now paste the link of any video from instagram or youtube and download
the audio or the video. it will take a few seconds so just wait a bit
